{"id":"aulastlog.8","n":"aulastlog","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"audit","ver":"3.1.5-4.el9","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/a/audit-3.1.5-4.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/aulastlog.8.gz","sha256":"93b152db2f39c7b5d075b5305f03f15f2b15590fa615f6247201a000fd7c2474","date":"June 2016","origin":"Red Hat"},"u":{"pkg":"auditd","ver":"1:3.0.7-1ubuntu0.1","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/a/audit/auditd_3.0.7-1ubuntu0.1_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/aulastlog.8.gz","sha256":"5c570a4473f3ca95b9c7f258a1ec84c64a4197771ced96918c62517ad7a707a6","date":"June 2016","origin":"Red Hat"}},"nopt":{"r":2,"u":2},"desc":"a program similar to lastlog","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>aulastlog - a program similar to lastlog</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>aulastlog [ options ]</b></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>aulastlog</b> is a program that prints out the last login for all users of the <b>local</b> machine similar to the way lastlog does. The login-name, port, and last login time will be printed.</p> <p>If the user has never logged in, the message <b>** Never logged in**</b> will be displayed instead of the port and time.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-u, --user</b></dt><dd>Print the lastlog record for user with specified LOGIN only.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--stdin</b></dt><dd>Use stdin as the source of audit records. The audit events must be in the raw format.</dd></dl>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>lastlog</b>(8), <b>ausearch</b>(8), <b>aureport</b>(8).</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Steve Grubb</p>"]]}